<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amalgamated sets 3-for-1 bonus issue. [CORRECTED 01:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amalgamated sets 3-for-1 bonus issue. [CORRECTED 01:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects ratio of bonus issue in headline and text to &quot;3-for-1&quot; from &quot;1-for-3&quot;)</p>
<p>Amalgamated Holdings Ltd said on Monday it has set a 3-for-1 bonus share issue, which will entitle shareholders to the final dividend of five cents a share that was declared earlier.</p>
</text>
